<title>INDIA: Schlumberger launches India subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Schlumberger launches India subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global engineering services company Schlumberger Ltd said on Wednesday it had set up a 100 percent-owned subsidiary, Schlumberger Measurement and Systems India Ltd to be headquartered in New Delhi.</p>
<p>&quot;The company will focus on electronic transaction products including smart cards, terminals and complete systems. The initial investment proposed is $10 million,&quot; Schlumberger said in a statement.</p>
</text>
